{"path":"atomic/atomic_notify_all","title":"std::atomic_notify_all","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>atomic_notify_all","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_notify_all","section":"atomic","kind":"page","summary":"Performs atomic notifying operations.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/atomic\">&lt;atomic&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> atomic_notify_all<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic\"><span class=\"kw2083\">std::<span class=\"me2\">atomic</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> object <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> atomic_notify_all<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">volatile</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic\"><span class=\"kw2083\">std::<span class=\"me2\">atomic</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> object <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Performs atomic notifying operations.\n</p><p>Unblocks all threads blocked in atomic waiting operations (i.e. <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_wait\">std::atomic_wait()</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_wait\">std::atomic_wait_explicit()</a></span>, or <a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic/wait\"><code>std::atomic::wait()</code></a>) on <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>object</span></code>, if there are any; otherwise does nothing.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">object<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>notify_all<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> object\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the atomic object to notify\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This form of change-detection is often more efficient than simple polling or pure spinlocks. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic/notify_one\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>notify_one</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  notifies at least one thread waiting on the atomic object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::atomic&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic/notify_all\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>notify_all</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  notifies all threads blocked waiting on the atomic object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::atomic&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_wait\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atomic_wait</span><span>atomic_wait_explicit</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  blocks the thread until notified and the atomic value changes <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_notify_one\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atomic_notify_one</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  notifies a thread blocked in atomic_wait <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"atomic","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::atomic_notify_all","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Performs atomic notifying operations."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"object"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Notes","note":"This form of change-detection is often more efficient than simple polling or pure spinlocks."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"notify_one","note":"notifies at least one thread waiting on the atomic object"},{"label":"notify_all","note":"notifies all threads blocked waiting on the atomic object"},{"label":"atomic_wait, atomic_wait_explicit","note":"blocks the thread until notified and the atomic value changes"},{"label":"atomic_notify_one","note":"notifies a thread blocked in atomic_wait"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":146,"codeBlockCount":0}
